            <sparkle:version>200</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.13.93</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.93

- Fixed the artwork getting stuck part-way off the overlay when swiping during a podcast. The swipe is now ignored outright for sources with no episode queue, instead of letting the cover move and then having nothing to complete the gesture.
- If a swipe finds no cover to move to, the artwork now glides back into place rather than staying where it was left.
]]></description>
